> 
> Hm, does that mean that snd_pcm_playback_avail() is never 0 for the dummy
> driver? Usually we should catch the signal_pending() in wait_for_avail().

Even with the dummy driver I'm not able to reproduce it. wait_for_avail()
gets called, thread goes to sleep and a Ctrl+C wakes it up with
signal_pending() set and it exits the syscall.
